Blockchain/Testing/USER SIMULATED TEST/runs/2026-04-28_cross-env_handoff.md:15:1. **F-DEMO-VERIFY-01 (CRITICAL, Demo only)** — verifier returns `verified:true` for `status:draft` documents that were never anchored or signed. Different `checks` schema from Local (`documentExists, isCertified, integrityVerified` vs Local's `exists, hasSignatures, blockchainAnchored`). Suggests Demo runs a different verifier-service implementation. **Don't use Demo for any customer demo until this is closed.**
